 "damage": {
  "note": "Used only to estimate how much a Star Force upgrade adds, relative to your current stats.",
  "formulas": [
   "Intro: All numbers in this page are decimals instead of percents.",
   "Calculation: approximate average output is the product of these unofficially named factors: 0.01; Current Applied Weapon Constant; Stat Multiplier; Attack Power/Magic ATT; Damage Multiplier; Final Damage Multiplier; [Multiplying only the factors above, while subtracting Boss Damage or Normal Enemy Damage from Damage Multiplier, outputs Default Damage Range]; Critical Damage Multiplier; Ignore Defense Multiplier; Ignore Elemental Resistance Multiplier; Level Multiplier; Map Multiplier; Skill Multiplier; Mastery Multiplier",
   "Stat Multiplier: For jobs except Demon Avenger: 4 (Main Stat 1 + Main Stat 2 + Main Stat 3) + Secondary Stat 1 + Secondary Stat 2; inapplicable Stats are 0",
   "Stat Multiplier: A Stat is floor(Base Value (1 + % Value)) + % Value Not Applied",
   "Stat Multiplier: All Stats increase STR, DEX, INT, and LUK; nothing else.",
   "Attack Power/Magic ATT: floor(Base Value (1 + % Value)) + % Value Not Applied",
   "Attack Power/Magic ATT: For jobs except Kanna: floor(Base Value (1 + % Value))",
   "Attack Power/Magic ATT: Magicians use Magic ATT; other jobs use Attack Power.",
   "Damage Multiplier: 1 + % Damage + % Boss Damage for bosses or 1 + % Damage + % Normal Enemy Damage for mobs",
   "Final Damage Multiplier: 1 + % Final Damage; Adding a source: (1 + % Final Damage without Source) (1 + Source)",
   "Critical Damage Multiplier: 1.35 [ref: average] + % Critical Damage for critical hits or 1 for non critical hits; Base % Critical Damage is a number between 1.2 and 1.5.",
   "Ignore Defense Multiplier: 1 - (% Enemy Defense (1 - % Ignore Defense)); If this multiplier is 0 or negative, output is 1 damage. Usually, mobs' % Defense is 0.1 and difficult bosses' Defense is 3.8.",
   "Ignore Defense Multiplier: % Ignore Defense = 1 - ((1 - Source 1) (1 - Source 2) (1 - Source 3) ...); Adding a source: 1 - ((1 - % Ignore Defense without Source) (1 - Source))",
   "Ignore Defense Multiplier: Each line of potential is a separate source.",
   "Ignore Elemental Resistance Multiplier: 0.5 (1 + % Ignore Elemental Resistance) for almost all bosses or 1 for almost all mobs",
   "Mastery Multiplier: 0.5 [ref: average] (1 + % Weapon Mastery)",
   "Stat Equivalence: Stat Multiplier = 4 (floor(Base Main Stat (1 + % Main Stat))) + 4 (% Main Stat Not Applied) + floor(Base Secondary Stat (1 + % Secondary Stat)) + % Secondary Stat Not Applied",
   "Stat Equivalence: relative change = (new - old) / old"
  ]
 }
